<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>alint third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 52rem;
         margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a1a1a; }
  h1 { border-bottom: 2px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5; padding-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .lede { color: #555; }
  .overview { columns: 2; }
  .used-by { columns: 2; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0.3rem 0 0.8rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6f8fa; padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; overflow-x: auto; }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>alint: third-party licenses</h1>
<p class="lede">This bundle lists every crate linked into the alint release
binary and reproduces its license text: its third-party dependencies, plus
alint's own first-party crates (under this repository's Apache-2.0 OR MIT dual
license). It is generated by <code>cargo-about</code> from the exact dependency
graph of the shipped binary; see <code>about.toml</code> in the source tree for
the accepted-license policy. Each distinct copyright text is preserved verbatim,
so a permissive license family (MIT, ISC, ...) appears once per distinct
copyright holder.</p>

<h2>Licenses in this bundle</h2>
<ul class="overview">
{{#each overview}}
  <li>{{name}} ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

{{#each licenses}}
<section class="license">
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="used-by">
{{#each used_by}}
  <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
